OL,3,AWife of assassinated ex-Haitian leader
OL,4,Aregisters for presidential election
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe widow of assassinated former
OL,7,FHaitian president Jovenel Moise has
OL,8,Fregistered as a presidential candidate
OL,9,Ffor next year's elections in the
OL,10,FCaribbean nation.
OL,12,FMartine Moise was injured in the gun
OL,13,Fattack that killed her husband at their
OL,14,Fhome in the capital, Port-au-Prince, in
OL,15,F2021.
OL,17,FHaiti, which last held an election in
OL,18,F2016, has been plagued with chronic
OL,19,Finstability and gang violence.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
